  "title": "Kaylee Hottle Death Investigation: Cause of Death Revealed After Maryland Crash",
  "summary": "Deaf Actress Known for “Godzilla” Films Dies at 18 Following Tragic Accident The entertainment world is mourning the loss of young actress Kaylee Hottle, a talented deaf performer who gained international recognition for her role in the “Godzilla” franchise. Authorities have now revealed the cause and manner of her death following a fatal vehicle accident in Maryland. According to the Maryland Chief Medical Examiner’s Office, Hottle died from multiple blunt force injuries caused by the crash.",
